IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL-SYSTEM.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-EMP-NAME         PIC X(20)   VALUE "JOHN DOE".
01  WS-HOURLY-RATE      PIC 99V99   VALUE 25.50.
01  WS-HOURS-WORKED     PIC 99      VALUE 40.
01  WS-GROSS-PAY        PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-TAX-RATE         PIC V99     VALUE .15.
01  WS-TAX-AMOUNT       PIC 9(4)V99.
01  WS-NET-PAY          PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-DISP-GROSS       PIC $$,$$9.99.
01  WS-DISP-TAX         PIC $$,$$9.99.
01  WS-DISP-NET         PIC $$,$$9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARAGRAPH.
    PERFORM COMPUTE-GROSS.
    PERFORM COMPUTE-TAX.
    PERFORM COMPUTE-NET.
    PERFORM DISPLAY-PAYROLL.
    STOP RUN.

COMPUTE-GROSS.
    COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = WS-HOURLY-RATE * WS-HOURS-WORKED.

COMPUTE-TAX.
    COMPUTE WS-TAX-AMOUNT = WS-GROSS-PAY * WS-TAX-RATE.

COMPUTE-NET.
    COMPUTE WS-NET-PAY = WS-GROSS-PAY - WS-TAX-AMOUNT.

DISPLAY-PAYROLL.
    MOVE WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-DISP-GROSS.
    MOVE WS-TAX-AMOUNT TO WS-DISP-TAX.
    MOVE WS-NET-PAY TO WS-DISP-NET.
    DISPLAY "--- PAYROLL STATEMENT ---".
    DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE: " WS-EMP-NAME.
    DISPLAY "GROSS PAY: " WS-DISP-GROSS.
    DISPLAY "TAX DEDUCTION: " WS-DISP-TAX.
    DISPLAY "NET PAY: " WS-DISP-NET.
    DISPLAY "-------------------------".
